        <mxCell id="U3PU9izSV82bIuXBHprD-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="Notes:&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;- MVP will not have any enclosure designed, just a bare module on a breadboard. Mechanical considerations TBD for final design, pending prototype learnings&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Battery will be soldered to underside of battery. Hence, headers will be used on the breadboard to give clearance for the bottom side of the NRF module.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
